    "description": "Decorative Collectibles Lot - 3 Pieces\nPorcelain Cat Head Pipe & Miniature Dutch Shoes\nThis three-piece collection features a decorative novelty pipe and a pair of miniature ceramic Dutch clog shoes. The pipe showcases an Asian zoomorphic design with a blue and white porcelain cat head bowl and a brass stem adorned with applied wire detailing. Accompanied by two Delft-style porcelain clogs painted with traditional windmills, this set appeals to collectors of feline memorabilia, tobacciana, and novelty miniatures.\nItems Included:\nPorcelain & brass pipe - Blue and white cat head bowl, brass stem with filigree trim, ~5.5 inches long\nMiniature Dutch clog (piece 1) - White ceramic with blue windmill motif, ~0.75 inches long\nMiniature Dutch clog (piece 2) - White ceramic with blue windmill motif, ~0.75 inches long\nCondition:\nPorcelain cat head bowl exhibits fine glaze crazing and surface wear. Brass stem shows age patina, minor tarnish, and exposed end threads. Ceramic shoes have minor shelf wear with no large chips or breaks.\nMerchandise is sold As Is. Returns will only be accepted with prior authorization and under the terms stated in this Return Policy. If you have questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item please contact Goodwill of Silicon Valley at 408-869-9262 prior to placing your bid. Items may be returned within seven (7) days of receipt if the merchandise was damaged during shipping or if there was a major distortion in the description. Returns will not be accepted without prior authorization. PLEASE NOTE THAT WE DO NOT REFUND SHIPPING AND HANDLING\nCHARGES. Items selected for pick up from the seller, must be picked up within thirty (30) days from close of auction. Items not picked up from seller within thirty (30) days from close of auction will be resold with no further\nnotice.\nLocal Pickup Policy\nAll items must be picked up within 30 days of purchase.\nAny item not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be resold without any prior notification.\nAll items picked up must be picked up by the individual named in the profile.\nNo 3rd party pickups without prior approval.\nIdentification is required to be shown when picking up all orders\nPayment for items not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be refunded automatically.\nAll pick-up orders must be paid for prior to pick-up. Payments will not be accepted on-site - no exceptions.\nNo Walk-Ins.\nIf you have not scheduled and received a confirmation of your pick up time, we will not be able to accommodate your pick up. Local pickup must be scheduled prior to arrival by calling Customer Service at 408-869-9262.\nThe pickup address for all items is 1600 Technology Drive, San Jose, CA 95110\nLocal pickup is available by appointment only and must be picked up within 30 days.",
